---
// src/components/Footer.astro
---

<footer id="contacto" class="bg-briella-charcoal text-white pt-14 pb-20 sm:pb-12 border-t border-briella-charcoal-light">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-white/10">
      
      <!-- Brand Story -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <a href="#" class="inline-block">
          <img 
            src="assets/images/logo-transparent.png" 
            alt="Joyería Briella" 
            class="h-8 w-auto object-contain brightness-0 invert" 
            width="140" 
            height="36"
          />
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Taller de joyería fina en Perú. Creamos piezas exclusivas en Plata Ley 950 y Oro 18k con acabado artesanal de alta precisión para tus momentos más memorables.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-2">
          <a 
            href="https://instagram.com/joyeriabriella" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/15 flex items-center justify-center text-white/80 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-all text-xs active:scale-95"
            aria-label="Instagram"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 stroke-[1.5]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
              <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect>
              <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path>
              <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"></line>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a 
            href="https://tiktok.com/@joyeriabriella" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/15 flex items-center justify-center text-white/80 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-all text-xs active:scale-95"
            aria-label="TikTok"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M19.59 6.69a4.83 4.83 0 0 1-3.77-4.25V2h-3.45v13.67a2.89 2.89 0 0 1-5.2 1.74 2.89 2.89 0 0 1 2.31-4.64c.29 0 .58.04.85.12V9.4a6.33 6.33 0 0 0-1-.08A6.34 6.34 0 0 0 3 15.66a6.34 6.34 0 0 0 10.82 4.46v-7.14a8.16 8.16 0 0 0 5.77 2.3v-3.5a4.78 4.78 0 0 1-3.5-1.42 4.7 4.7 0 0 1-.5-3.67z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Collections -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-luxury text-white mb-4">Colecciones</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-white/60">
          <li><a href="#catalogo" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Aretes de Plata Ley 950</a></li>
          <li><a href="#catalogo" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Collares &amp; Cadenas</a></li>
          <li><a href="#catalogo" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Pulseras &amp; Tobilleras</a></li>
          <li><a href="#catalogo" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Anillos &amp; Solitarios</a></li>
          <li><a href="#personalizados" class="text-briella-blue-light hover:text-white transition-colors font-medium">Joyas con Nombre Personalizado</a></li>
          <li><a href="#catalogo" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Colección Oro 18k</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Quality Guarantee -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-luxury text-white mb-4">Garantía &amp; Cuidado</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-white/60">
          <li><a href="#catalogo" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Certificado Plata 950</a></li>
          <li><a href="#catalogo" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Garantía Oro 18k Nacional</a></li>
          <li><a href="#personalizados" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Guía de Tallas para Anillos</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contacto" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Cuidados y Mantenimiento</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contacto" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Envíos Lima &amp; Provincias</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Customer Service & WhatsApp -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-luxury text-white mb-4">Atención al Cliente</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-white/70">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-briella-whatsapp flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91C2.13 13.66 2.59 15.36 3.45 16.86L2.05 22L7.3 20.62C8.75 21.41 10.38 21.83 12.04 21.83C17.5 21.83 21.95 17.38 21.95 11.92C21.95 6.46 17.5 2 12.04 2M12.04 20.15C10.56 20.15 9.11 19.76 7.85 19L7.55 18.83L4.43 19.65L5.26 16.61L5.06 16.29C4.24 15 3.8 13.47 3.8 11.91C3.8 7.37 7.5 3.67 12.04 3.67C16.58 3.67 20.28 7.37 20.28 11.92C20.28 16.46 16.58 20.15 12.04 20.15M16.57 14.45C16.32 14.32 15.1 13.72 14.87 13.64C14.64 13.55 14.48 13.51 14.31 13.76C14.15 14.01 13.67 14.57 13.52 14.73C13.38 14.9 13.23 14.92 12.98 14.8C12.73 14.67 11.93 14.41 10.98 13.57C10.24 12.91 9.74 12.1 9.6 11.85C9.45 11.6 9.58 11.47 9.71 11.34C9.82 11.23 9.96 11.05 10.09 10.91C10.21 10.76 10.26 10.66 10.34 10.5C10.42 10.33 10.38 10.19 10.32 10.07C10.26 9.94 9.77 8.74 9.56 8.25C9.36 7.76 9.16 7.83 9.01 7.82C8.87 7.81 8.71 7.81 8.54 7.81C8.38 7.81 8.11 7.87 7.88 8.12C7.65 8.37 7 8.98 7 10.21C7 11.44 7.9 12.63 8.02 12.79C8.15 12.96 9.78 15.47 12.28 16.55C12.87 16.81 13.33 16.96 13.69 17.07C14.29 17.26 14.83 17.23 15.26 17.17C15.74 17.1 16.74 16.57 16.95 15.99C17.15 15.41 17.15 14.92 17.09 14.8C17.03 14.7 16.82 14.57 16.57 14.45Z"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <span class="block text-[11px] text-white/50">WhatsApp Oficial:</span>
              <a href="https://wa.me/51923340617" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white font-bold hover:text-briella-whatsapp transition-colors">
                +51 923 340 617
              </a>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white/50 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 stroke-[1.5]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <span class="block text-[11px] text-white/50">Horarios de Atención:</span>
              <span>Lun - Sáb: 9:00 AM - 8:00 PM</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] text-white/50">
      <div>
        &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Joyería Briella. Todos los derechos reservados.
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>Medios de pago:</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-white/10 text-white rounded-full text-[10px]">Yape</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-white/10 text-white rounded-full text-[10px]">Plin</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-white/10 text-white rounded-full text-[10px]">BCP</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-white/10 text-white rounded-full text-[10px]">BBVA</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
